    <h3 id="personal-training">12. Personal training and fitness classes</h3>
    <p>Certified trainers can work with clients in building gyms, parks or apartments. Small group sessions in Prospect Park or Riverside Park lower per-person prices while raising your hourly take.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $50–$120/session</li><li><b>Startup:</b> Certification</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Early mornings</li></ul>
  </div>
