    <p>Piano, guitar, voice and language lessons are in demand among parents and adult learners. In a city this diverse, native speakers of Mandarin, Spanish, French, Korean and Italian find steady students.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $40–$90/hr</li><li><b>Startup:</b> $0</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Musicians, bilingual speakers</li></ul>
