    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> Varies by product</li><li><b>Startup:</b> $200–$600 plus booth fees</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Makers</li></ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hustle-card">
    <h3 id="home-chef">20. Meal prep and private cooking</h3>
