<p>Across the Hudson, rents are a bit lower and the rules differ. Compare with the <a href="/best-side-hustles-in-jersey-city/">best side hustles in Jersey City</a>, <a href="/best-side-hustles-in-newark/">Newark</a> and, out on Long Island, <a href="/best-side-hustles-in-islip/">Islip</a>. Better Side Hustles readers in New York tend to do best when they pick one gig, protect a few hours a week for it and give it 90 days before judging the results.</p>
